{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜结构图\n当前实现与兼容层。运行时图见 [[GGYGO_流程_动画表现.canvas|表现流程]]、[[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|曲线子图]]；[[Animation/结构|结构文档]]。\n普攻资产：[[Animation/普攻动画实施|契约、调查与验收]]（资产已保存/待接线验收）。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CMC / ASC / Pawn（权威）\nCMC：`GetResolvedGait` / `HasMoveInput` / `IsTurnBackCurveDriven`。\nASC：GameplayTag 状态。Pawn：位置与朝向。\n[[Movement/结构]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateCapture\n`Capture(OutFrame, OutDebug, Pawn)` → 在游戏线程取 CMC/ASC/Pawn 事实，集中处理缺失来源。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateFrame\n`bHasMoveInput`、步态、转身相位、状态 Tag 等只读语义；不存 ABP 状态名或连线。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAnimInstanceBase\n`NativeUpdateAnimation(dt)` → 更新 StateFrame。\n`HasAnimationStateTag(Tag)` / `IsAnimationRunGait()` / `IsTurnBackCurveDriven()` → 供 AnimBP 过渡图查询。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "abp",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ABP_Pyrios\n过渡图读取 StateFrame；GetSeqByKey / GetBlendSpaceByKey 取资产。\nEnterMove / Stop / TurnBack 单次播放。\nWalkRun：X 轴 WalkRunBlendAlpha 读取旧字段 GaitBlendY（蓝图显示 Walk Run Blend Alpha）。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UZZZAnimInstance / Snapshot（兼容）\nStateFrame → 旧 Snapshot 的纯适配。\n`FZZZLocomotionEvents` 当前仍更新 `StateMemory.StopValue` / `GaitBlendY`；迁移计划见 [[计划_动画与表现层]]。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FZZZAnimSet / FZZZAnimTuning\n动画键到序列/BlendSpace 的表与混合参数；曲线链见 [[GGYGO_结构_动画曲线.canvas|曲线结构子图]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 事实到表现的接口边界\nUE → AnimInstanceBase::NativeUpdateAnimation(dt) → StateCapture::Capture(OutState, OutDebug, Pawn)。\nCapture 从 CMC/ASC/Pawn 读权威事实，写 AnimationStateFrame；AnimBP 通过查询函数/StateFrame 决定状态、资产与过渡。\nZZZAnimInstance::NativeUpdateAnimation → LegacySnapshotAdapter::Capture 仅适配旧 Snapshot；StopValue/GaitBlendY 兼容记忆当前仍在 C++，目标才迁入蓝图。\nAnimBP 不应回调 CMC 来决定玩法位移；曲线反读例外见曲线结构子图。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_sources",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 普攻 AnimSequence（已存在）\nNormal_01/02/03 与对应 End：60 fps，共用 Pyrios Skeleton。\n无 Notify，原生 Root Motion=false；含 RootMotion_* 曲线。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|资产事实与契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_montages",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 三份普攻 Montage（初版已保存）\nAM_Pyrios_Attack_Normal_01/02/03。Main → End → 停止，Slot=FullBody。\nMain 全段 + End 前 30/45/90 帧（60 fps）；BlendIn/Out=0.10/0.25 s。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|实际帧区间与验证范围]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 战斗侧 GA（跨模块契约）\nUGGYGOPlayerComboAbility / FGGYGOComboStep 持有各段 Montage 引用。\nGA 决定换段、输入缓存、伤害和异常清理；动画不保存角色级战斗状态。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA 实施计划]]",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_notify",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GameplayEventWindow（已配置/回读）\n60 fps：Hit=4–14 / 4–15 / 20–54。\nCombo=16–115 / 17–99 / 56–102，分别跨入 End 14/18/18 帧。\n独立轨发 Event.Montage 的 ComboWindow 与 HitWindow Begin/End；游戏内待验收。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_slot_gate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FullBody Slot（骨架已注册）\n当前 ABP 主图无 Slot，最终接线暂停。\nModifyBone 固定 Bip001 组件位置；CMC 仍反读 RootMotion_*。\n待移动策略明确后验证网格/胶囊一致性。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|证据与当前缺口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
